fx0 demo (xbm/apps/fx0)

This demo is a static gallery inspired by fx0 (https://github.com/vercel-labs/fx0),
Copyright Vercel, Inc., licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE-fx0).
It does not include fx0 source code; it reproduces the idea of design.md presets
and per-turn versions with pre-generated sample output (示例数据).

The style preset names and color tokens are taken from fx0's bundled design.md
presets (lib/design-md/), which come from VoltAgent/awesome-design-md
(https://github.com/VoltAgent/awesome-design-md), Copyright (c) 2026 VoltAgent,
MIT License (see LICENSE-design-md).
